    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,2.6rem);color:var(--teal-dark);">"I'll help care for your home — if you'll show it to me."</h1>
    <p>That's Koa's promise, made fresh in every book. He's a koala who travels the Pacific coastline by coastline, with Gully the seagull causing trouble in the background, meeting a new local friend at every stop.</p>
    <p>Koa's Beach Adventures started as a children's book series — it's become something bigger: a small, real mission called Catalyx One, that the books help fund.</p>
