    <span class="eyebrow">The Real Mission</span>
    <h2 style="color:var(--teal-dark);">Catalyx One</h2>
    <p>Catalyx One is a Pacific environmental initiative in two stages. Here's honestly where it stands:</p>

    <div class="stage-card current">
      <span class="tag">Current stage</span>
      <h3>Sorting, separating, and recycling household waste</h3>
      <p style="margin:8px 0 0;color:#555;">This is the work happening now.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stage-card future">
      <span class="tag">Future stage — funding-dependent</span>
      <h3>Converting remaining waste into electricity and fuel, instead of ocean pollution</h3>
      <p style="margin:8px 0 0;color:#555;">This is the goal, not a current capability — it depends on the funding below.</p>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:24px;">Koa's Beach Adventures proudly supports the environmental mission of Catalyx One, encouraging cleaner beaches, healthier oceans, and a more sustainable future across the Pacific. A portion of proceeds from every book and every Beach Shack purchase funds Catalyx One's development.</p>
  </div>
</section>

